<section class="screen list-screen" id="crossings"><div class="topbar"><div class="brand">MINUKIMI</div><button class="icon" onclick="nav('discover')">←</button></div><div class="section-title"><h1>Crossings</h1><p>People where interest went both ways.</p></div><div class="chat-list"><div class="chat-row" onclick="openChat('Maya')"><div class="avatar">M</div><div><b>Maya</b><p>You both connected today.</p></div><time>now</time></div><div class="chat-row" onclick="openChat('Daniel')"><div class="avatar">D</div><div><b>Daniel</b><p>Still curious?</p></div><time>1d</time></div></div><nav class="bottom-nav"><button class="nav-item" data-nav="discover"><span>◌</span><span>Discover</span></button><button class="nav-item active" data-nav="crossings"><span>⌁</span><span>Crossings</span></button><button class="nav-item" data-nav="chats"><span>▢</span><span>Chats</span></button><button class="nav-item" data-nav="myProfile"><span>○</span><span>You</span></button></nav></section>
<section class="screen list-screen" id="chats"><div class="topbar"><div class="brand">MINUKIMI</div><button class="icon" onclick="nav('discover')">←</button></div><div class="section-title"><h1>Conversations</h1><p>Ordinary chat, after a deliberate connection.</p></div><div class="chat-list"><div class="chat-row" onclick="openChat('Maya')"><div class="avatar">M</div><div><b>Maya</b><p>I still want to know why the sea :)</p></div><time>now</time></div><div class="chat-row" onclick="openChat('Daniel')"><div class="avatar">D</div><div><b>Daniel</b><p>That was unexpectedly specific.</p></div><time>1h</time></div></div><nav class="bottom-nav"><button class="nav-item" data-nav="discover"><span>◌</span><span>Discover</span></button><button class="nav-item" data-nav="crossings"><span>⌁</span><span>Crossings</span></button><button class="nav-item active" data-nav="chats"><span>▢</span><span>Chats</span></button><button class="nav-item" data-nav="myProfile"><span>○</span><span>You</span></button></nav></section>
<section class="screen chat-screen" id="chat"><div class="chat-head"><button class="icon" onclick="show('chats')">←</button><div class="who"><b id="chatName">Maya</b><small>You found each other</small></div><button class="icon" onclick="document.getElementById('safetyModal').classList.add('show')">•••</button></div><div class="messages" id="messages"><div class="bubble them">I liked your “In my head” line. Why the sea?</div><div class="bubble me">Because every version of me that feels awake seems to be near water.</div><div class="bubble them">That is annoyingly good 😄</div></div><div class="composer"><input id="msgInput" placeholder="Write a message"><button class="send" id="sendBtn">↑</button></div></section>
<section class="screen profile-screen" id="myProfile"><div class="topbar"><button class="icon" onclick="nav('discover')">←</button><div class="brand">MINUKIMI</div><button class="icon" onclick="show('settings')">⚙</button></div><div class="page"><div class="me-hero"><img id="mePhoto" alt="" style="display:none;width:86px;height:86px;border-radius:26px;object-fit:cover;margin-bottom:15px"><h2 id="meName">Your profile</h2><p id="meMeta">Complete your profile to appear in discovery.</p><div class="preview-prompt" style="margin-top:14px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.5);color:#3f4250"><small>In my head, I'm...</small><div id="mePrompt">...</div></div></div><div class="edit-block"><label>Edit signature line</label><textarea id="editPrompt" maxlength="110"></textarea><button class="cta save" id="saveEdit">Save</button></div><div class="edit-block"><button class="secondary wide" onclick="show('profilePhoto')">Edit photos</button><button class="secondary wide" style="margin-top:8px" onclick="show('profileBasics')">Edit details</button><button class="secondary wide" style="margin-top:8px" onclick="show('preferences')">Preferences</button><button class="secondary wide" style="margin-top:8px" onclick="show('verification')">Verification</button><button class="secondary wide" style="margin-top:8px" onclick="show('safety')">Safety</button></div></div><nav class="bottom-nav"><button class="nav-item" data-nav="discover"><span>◌</span><span>Discover</span></button><button class="nav-item" data-nav="crossings"><span>⌁</span><span>Crossings</span></button><button class="nav-item" data-nav="chats"><span>▢</span><span>Chats</span></button><button class="nav-item active" data-nav="myProfile"><span>○</span><span>You</span></button></nav></section>
<section class="screen" id="preferences"><div class="topbar"><button class="icon" onclick="show('myProfile')">←</button><div class="brand">MINUKIMI</div><span class="ghost-slot"></span></div><div class="page"><div class="kicker">Preferences</div><h1 class="headline">Who should cross your path?</h1><p class="sub">Keep discovery broad enough to surprise you, but useful enough to matter.</p><div class="field-grid"><div class="field"><label>Age range</label><input type="text" value="27–42"></div><div class="field"><label>Distance</label><select><option>25 km</option><option>50 km</option><option>100 km</option><option>Anywhere</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Looking for</label><select><option>Everyone</option><option>Women</option><option>Men</option></select></div></div><button class="cta wide" style="margin-top:12px" onclick="toast('Saved');show('myProfile')">Save preferences</button></div></section>
<section class="screen" id="verification"><div class="topbar"><button class="icon" onclick="show('myProfile')">←</button><div class="brand">MINUKIMI</div><span class="ghost-slot"></span></div><div class="page"><div class="kicker">Trust</div><h1 class="headline">Verification.</h1><p class="sub">A simple identity and selfie check will live here. It should confirm you are real without turning the profile into paperwork.</p><div class="photo-rule"><i class="good-dot"></i><span>Phone verification · planned</span></div><div class="photo-rule"><i class="good-dot"></i><span>Selfie match · planned</span></div><button class="secondary wide" onclick="show('myProfile')">Back</button></div></section>
<section class="screen" id="safety"><div class="topbar"><button class="icon" onclick="show('myProfile')">←</button><div class="brand">MINUKIMI</div><span class="ghost-slot"></span></div><div class="page"><div class="kicker">Safety</div><h1 class="headline">Leave quickly when you need to.</h1><p class="sub">Typing <b>KIMI</b> in a chat never sends the word. It opens a private exit: end, block or report.</p><div class="edit-block"><label>Always available</label><p class="sub" style="margin:0">End connection · Block · Report</p></div><button class="secondary wide" onclick="show('myProfile')">Back</button></div></section>
<section class="screen" id="settings"><div class="topbar"><button class="icon" onclick="show('myProfile')">←</button><div class="brand">MINUKIMI</div><span class="ghost-slot"></span></div><div class="page"><div class="kicker">Settings</div><h1 class="headline">Settings.</h1><div class="edit-block"><button class="secondary wide" onclick="toast('Notifications updated')">Notifications</button><button class="secondary wide" style="margin-top:8px" onclick="show('safety')">Privacy & safety</button><button class="secondary wide" style="margin-top:8px" id="resetProfile">Reset prototype profile</button></div></div></section>
